he Gerrit compose network address 172.21.0.3. Manual /review/rerun with the SSM token succeeded and the bot voted LLM-Review+1; a host-side comparison also showed SSM, /opt/rebar/infra/compose/.env, the running review-bot container GERRIT_BOT_TOKEN, and refs/meta/config webhooks.config X-Rebar-Token all share the same token hash. This suggests either stale queued webhook deliveries, another webhook source without the header, or a plugin reload/delivery edge. Acceptance criteria: identify the source of the 401 deliveries, prove whether current patchset-created/comment-added webhooks carry X-Rebar-Token, eliminate any stale unauthenticated producer or document it as harmless bounded residue, and add an operator-visible signal if live webhooks are auth-dead while /health remains 200.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ops","review-bot"],"ticket_id":"073f-b86f-42c6-456f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Gerrit webhooks still emit missing-or-invalid token rejects after rotation","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["2ab0733f-2293-48ca-bdc0-91ce0851b263","f4a2f81e-f8f0-43e7-ae69-31233beed4f3"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788925045950149001,"uuid":"641581ca-e22e-47d1-bed0-bfad321a9b42"}